    "case_scope": "Two byte orders round-trip NXS/CVXM/version7, u16/u32/f32 and three-float array through concrete memory_input61 and growable_output61 virtual services. Wrong tag rejects after8 consumed bytes; stream cursor/ownership and stack/low-LR checked. u16-array writer compiled/source-reviewed only. No volatile-state/full-RAM/bitwiseFP/nonfinite or malformed-input matrix and no gameplay acceptance. Existing float/header writers are forwarded to mesh_stream_write61 and receive no duplicate implementation credit. Both byte orders also decode ICE headers through concrete borrowed adapter tails and decode u8/u16/u32 indices into word output. Halfword-output adaptive mode and float/double adapter tails are compiled/source-reviewed, not separately exercised.",
    "remaining_boundary": "Live stream callbacks retain their original mutable context and failure behavior; higher geometry loader remains pending."
